# FIN-015: FY 2025 Budget Plan

**Document ID:** FIN-015  
**Title:** FY 2025 Budget Plan  
**Company:** MedSync Health  
**Currency:** United Arab Emirates Dirham (AED)  
**Date:** January 17, 2026

---

## 1. Executive Summary

The Fiscal Year 2025 (FY 2025) Budget Plan for MedSync Health is strategically focused on achieving operational profitability and optimizing our cost structure in preparation for a potential Initial Public Offering (IPO). Building on the strong revenue growth of FY 2024, the FY 2025 plan projects a 25% year-over-year revenue increase, reaching **AED 606,375,000**. This growth will be coupled with a disciplined approach to operating expenses, aiming to shift the company from an operating loss of AED 19,719,000 in FY 2024 to a projected operating income of **AED 96,937,500** in FY 2025.

The key financial objective for FY 2025 is to demonstrate a sustainable, profitable growth model, primarily by improving efficiency in Research & Development (R&D), Sales & Marketing (S&M), and General & Administrative (G&A) expenses as a percentage of total revenue.

