## 6. Compliance and Risk Management

The FY 2025 budget includes dedicated resources for maintaining and expanding our compliance certifications. The Finance & Legal department budget (AED 25,526,250) is structured to support the ongoing SEC readiness process.

*   **Security & Compliance:** Continued investment in the MedSync Compliance Suite (PROD-COMPLIANCE) is a priority. For a detailed breakdown of our security posture and compliance roadmap, **See SEC-001 for compliance details**.
*   **Legal & Regulatory:** The budget allocates funds for external counsel to navigate the IPO process and international regulatory changes, particularly in the EMEA and APAC regions.

